{'symbol': 'ETN', 'date': '2023-04-25 11:12:00', 'title': 'EATON DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYABLE MAY 26, 2023', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF INTELLIGENT POWER MANAGEMENT COMPANY EATON (NYSE:ETN) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.86 PER ORDINARY SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MAY 26, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 8, 2023. EATON HAS PAID DIVIDENDS ON ITS SHARES EVERY YEAR SINCE 1923. EATON IS AN INTELLIGENT POWER MANAGEMENT COMPANY DEDICATED TO IMPROVING THE QUALITY OF LIFE AND PROTECTING THE ENVIRONMENT FOR PEOPLE EVERYWHERE. WE ARE GUIDED BY.'}